    IF `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of the withdrawal of eligibility for appointment as a statutory auditor`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of a notice requiring the person responsible for any breach to cease the conduct and abstain from repeating it`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of a public statement identifying the person responsible and the nature of the breach`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of a temporary prohibition preventing a person responsible from carrying out statutory audits or signing audit reports`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of a temporary prohibition of up to three years preventing a person responsible from exercising specified functions in a firm that is eligible for appointment as a statutory auditor or in a public interest entity`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of a declaration that the audit report does not satisfy the audit reporting requirements and where appropriate a declaration as to the proportion of the audit fee that is not payable`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of an appropriate financial penalty`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of a requirement to take action to mitigate the effect or prevent the recurrence of the contravention`
       AND `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the sanction of exclusion from membership of the body`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The arrangements for enforcement must include provision for sanctions which include"

-- src:20242 | (c) include provision for the body to make available to the public information relating to the steps it has taken to ensure the effective enforcement of its rules.
@ref sch 10 para 12(3)(c) Enforcement: information made available to the public (src:20242-20242)
GIVEN `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the body to make available to the public information relating to the steps it has taken to ensure the effective enforcement of its rules` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 12(3)(c) the body meets the requirement` MEANS
    IF `the arrangements for enforcement include provision for the body to make available to the public information relating to the steps it has taken to ensure the effective enforcement of its rules`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The arrangements for enforcement must include provision for the body to make available to the public information"

-- src:20243 | (4) The sanctions referred to in sub-paragraph (3)(b)(v) must apply to persons who are no longer members of the body as they apply to members.
