    IF `the sanctions referred to in sub-paragraph (3)(b)(v) apply to persons who are no longer members of the body as they apply to members`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The sanctions referred to in sub-paragraph (3)(b)(v) must apply to persons who are no longer members of the body as they apply to members"

