GIVEN `the arrangements referred to in sub-paragraph (1)(a) make provision for inspections to be conducted by the competent authority or any recognised supervisory body to whom that authority has delegated tasks in accordance with regulation 3 of the 2016 Regulations` IS A BOOLEAN
