GIVEN `the arrangements include an inspection conducted in relation to each person eligible for appointment as a statutory auditor at such frequency as the body considers appropriate given the risks arising from the statutory audit work undertaken by the person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 13(3)(b)(i) the arrangements meet the requirement` MEANS
    IF `the arrangements include an inspection conducted in relation to each person eligible for appointment as a statutory auditor at such frequency as the body considers appropriate given the risks arising from the statutory audit work undertaken by the person`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The arrangements referred to in sub-paragraph (1)(a) must include an inspection which is conducted in relation to each person eligible for appointment as a statutory auditor"

-- src:20270 | (b) include an inspection which is conducted in relation to each person eligible for appointment as a statutory auditor—
-- src:20271 | (i) at such frequency as the body considers appropriate given the risks arising from the statutory audit work undertaken by the person eligible for appointment as a statutory auditor; and
-- src:20272 | (ii) at least once every six years in the case of a person who, during any of the previous five years, has carried out a statutory audit of an entity not subject to the small companies regime (see section 381).
@ref sch 10 para 13(3)(b)(ii) At least once every six years for an auditor of an entity not subject to the small companies regime (src:20270-20272)
GIVEN `during any of the previous five years the person has carried out a statutory audit of an entity` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 381 Companies subject to the small companies regime` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the date of the previous inspection of the person` IS A DATE
      `the day asked about` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 13(3)(b)(ii) another inspection of the person is due by the day asked about` MEANS
    IF NOT `during any of the previous five years the person has carried out a statutory audit of an entity`
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in the case of a person who, during any of the previous five years, has carried out a statutory audit of an entity not subject to the small companies regime"
    ELSE CONSIDER `s 381 Companies subject to the small companies regime`
         WHEN JUST TRUE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the entity is subject to the small companies regime
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): section 381 (coa8) decides whether the entity is subject to the small companies regime
         WHEN JUST FALSE THEN
             IF `the day asked about` AT LEAST `sch 10 para 3(2) the first day after a period of months beginning with a date` `the date of the previous inspection of the person` 72
             THEN JUST TRUE
             ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "at least once every six years"

-- src:20273 | (4) The arrangements must provide that the determination by the body of the frequency of inspections under sub-paragraph (3)(b)(i) is subject to any direction by the competent authority.
