GIVEN `the arrangements provide that the determination by the body of the frequency of inspections under sub-paragraph (3)(b)(i) is subject to any direction by the competent authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 13(4) the arrangements meet the requirement` MEANS
    IF `the arrangements provide that the determination by the body of the frequency of inspections under sub-paragraph (3)(b)(i) is subject to any direction by the competent authority`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The arrangements must provide that"

-- src:20274 | (5) The inspection must be conducted by persons who—
-- src:20275 | (a) have an appropriate professional education;
-- src:20276 | (b) have experience of—
-- src:20277 | (i) statutory audit work, ...
-- src:20278 | (ii) equivalent work, for the purposes of an appointment of a person to conduct inspections made prior to IP completion day, on the audit of accounts under the law of an EEA State, or part of an EEA State, or
-- src:20279 | (iii) equivalent work, for the purpose of an appointment of a person to conduct inspections, on the audit of accounts under the law of—
-- src:20280 | (aa) an equivalent third country or part of an equivalent third country, or
-- src:20281 | (bb) a transitional third country or part of a transitional third country;
-- src:20282 | (c) have received adequate training in the conduct of inspections;
-- src:20283 | (d) have declared that they do not have any interests likely to conflict with the proper conduct of the inspection;
-- src:20284 | (e) have not been an employee or partner or member of the management body of the person subject to inspection and have not been otherwise associated with that person for at least three years before the inspection.
@ref sch 10 para 13(5) Who may conduct an inspection (src:20274-20284)
GIVEN `the inspector has an appropriate professional education` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the inspector has experience of statutory audit work` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the inspector has experience of equivalent work for the purposes of an appointment to conduct inspections made before IP completion day on the audit of accounts under the law of an EEA State` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the inspector has experience of equivalent work for the purpose of an appointment to conduct inspections on the audit of accounts under the law of an equivalent third country or a transitional third country` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the inspector has received adequate training in the conduct of inspections` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the inspector has declared that they do not have any interests likely to conflict with the proper conduct of the inspection` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the inspector last was an employee, partner or member of the management body of the person subject to inspection or otherwise associated with that person` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the date of the inspection` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 10 para 13(5) the inspector is a person by whom the inspection may be conducted` MEANS
    IF    `the inspector has an appropriate professional education`
       AND (    `the inspector has experience of statutory audit work`
             OR `the inspector has experience of equivalent work for the purposes of an appointment to conduct inspections made before IP completion day on the audit of accounts under the law of an EEA State`
             OR `the inspector has experience of equivalent work for the purpose of an appointment to conduct inspections on the audit of accounts under the law of an equivalent third country or a transitional third country`)
       AND `the inspector has received adequate training in the conduct of inspections`
       AND `the inspector has declared that they do not have any interests likely to conflict with the proper conduct of the inspection`
       AND `no association with the person inspected within the three years before the inspection`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The inspection must be conducted by persons who"
    WHERE
        `no association with the person inspected within the three years before the inspection` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the date the inspector last was an employee, partner or member of the management body of the person subject to inspection or otherwise associated with that person`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
            WHEN JUST lastassociated THEN
                `the date of the inspection` AT LEAST `sch 10 para 3(2) the first day after a period of months beginning with a date` lastassociated 36

